This dataset describes the transport of natural gas on a freight ship between the liquefaction plant in MY and a 0 evaporation plant.
Location: not known
Technology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_165218cb-dc4e-3159-bfdb-a203e44ebc44.xml</text>
